    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d91">

                <pb facs="0201" n="101" sameAs="frus:frus1934v01/pg101"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15A4 General Committee/953: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-06-05T12:00:00+01:00">June 5,
                            1934—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received June 5—7:27 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>871. My 868, June 4, 10 p.m. The situation appears so tense today that I have
                    decided not to present the resolution sent you last night <pb facs="0202"
                        n="102" xml:id="pg102"/> unless I can get agreement between the British and
                    French before doing so.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
